WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
Two long straight wires hang side by side,

2
00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.240
parallel, with a small gap between them.

3
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.350
Neither wire is a magnet.

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.070
Now switch on a current in
each, flowing the same way.

5
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.870
Each current makes a magnetic
field around its own wire.

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.240
So do the wires pull together, push apart,

7
00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.900
or ignore each other?

8
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.090
And why?

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.670
In this mission, you'll calculate the
force between two wires each carrying 10

10
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.440
amps, and then compare the forces
on two wires whose currents differ.

11
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.440
Then you'll find the point between two
wires where their magnetic fields cancel.

12
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:40.330
Your mission: predict whether
the wires attract or repel,

13
00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.640
and explain why.
